All notable user-facing changes to `qql-go`. Format inspired by [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/).

---

## Latest — 0.5.0 (2026-06-19)

See the [full 0.5.0 release notes](/docs/changelog/releases/0.5.0).

{% aside type="tip" title="Highlights" %}
- Security gateway with JWT auth, YAML policy engine, AST filter injection, rate limiting, and audit logging
- Multivector (ColBERT / ColPali) support — `WITH MULTIVECTOR (comparator = 'max_sim')`
- Standalone `FUSION` syntax (no `FROM` required)
- `qql-go convert` — REST JSON → QQL converter
- Python SDK HTTP interceptor (`qql_intercept.py`)
{% /aside %}

---

